OL,3,ASotheby's auction of $180m Van Gogh
OL,4,Achallenged over claims it was 'sold
OL,5,Aunder duress'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuction house Sotheby's says it is
OL,8,Fworking to resolve a dispute over the
OL,9,Fintended sale of a painting by Vincent
OL,10,Fvan Gogh.
OL,12,FChataigniers en Fleurs, which carries
OL,13,Fan estimate of $180m (#136m), is due to
OL,14,Fgo under the hammer in New York on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,17,FBut representatives acting for heirs of
OL,18,Fthe Fischer family - earlier German
OL,19,Fowners of the work - say it may have
OL,20,Fbeen sold under duress during the rise
OL,21,Fof the Nazis.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
